ORDER_INDEPENDENT_VERDICT (38 permutations over 4 record sets collapse to 1 position-free observable each — same read result, same gap codes, same FULL diagnostic report, same quarantined set; 0 bare TypeErrors; comparator discriminated by all 3 negative controls)
MALFORMED_REPORTED_BEHIND_SATISFIER (12/12 flavour x depth cases retained verbatim at their true index 1/2/3, 0/12 silent; and 3 malformed entries stacked behind one satisfier are ALL reported, so detection is exhaustive rather than first-match)
O2_SILENT_CORRUPTION_PINNED (row O2 [satisfying, malformed]: with the read boundary BYPASSED the gate returns SATISFIED with no throw and the malformed record stays in `records` unreported; through the validated boundary the SAME bytes are quarantined verbatim at index 1 and removed from the clean set, with the verdict unchanged — unvalidatedCodes=[], unvalidatedQuarantined=0, validatedCodes=[], validatedQuarantinedIndex=1)
